              <li><strong>No Admin or website owner can read your Personal Notes or Bookmarks.</strong> They are fully secure in the system.</li>
              <li>Admins only work to protect the website from spam and maintain a healthy environment.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-card">
            <div class="rule-icon">🗑️</div>
            <h3 class="rule-title">Account Deletion</h3>
            <ul class="rule-list">
              <li>You can submit an account deletion request anytime by visiting Settings.</li>
              <li>Upon deletion, your name, email, and photo will be completely erased from the system within <strong>30 days</strong>.</li>
              <li>Comments made by you will remain on the website (to help others), but your name will be removed from them (they will become Anonymous).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TERMS OF SERVICE CARD -->
    <div class="legal-card">
      <button class="legal-card-header" aria-expanded="false">
